      "created_at": "2018-04-16T16:26:15.000Z",
      "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote group-playtesters\" data-username=\"Blackfang108\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/b/74df32/48.png\" class=\"avatar\"> Blackfang108:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p><b>X-metal wrote:</b></p>\n<div><blockquote>I feel much better knowing that christooher and adam had to deal with snow in spring to.\n&nbsp;\n</blockquote></div>\nThere is snow on the ground today, 16 April 2018 in Chicago.Mother Nature is being petty now.\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>Several areas of Toronto were without power this morning, due to a snow/ice storm that started Saturday morning and has been going continuously since since.&nbsp; Thankfully(?) the snow/ice/hail transitioned into rain some time around 9/10pm Sunday night, so now we've got water on top of the snow/ice.&nbsp; Apparently it's supposed to change back to snow tomorrow.</p>\n<p>\"Petty\" isn't the word I'd use… more like \"clearly helping OblivAeon to destroy humanity\".</p>",
